  Slug: bloodline-genie
  DisplayName: 'Bloodline: Genie'
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/genie.webp
  Description: 'Through lineage, magic, or wishes made real, the blood of a noble
    genie flows through your veins. Spell List arcane Bloodline Skills Arcana, Deception
    Granted Spells cantrip: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic];
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise]; 2nd: variable
    (see Genie Type below); 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enthrall];
    4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Creation]; 5th: variable (see Genie
    Type below); 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight]; 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Energy
    Aegis]; 8th: variable (see Genie Type below); 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Resplendent
    Mansion] Bloodline Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Genie''s
    Veil]; advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heart''s Desire]; greater:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish-Twisted Form] Blood Magic Your spellcasting
    warps reality and distracts your foes. Either you gain a +1 status bonus to Deception
    checks for 1 round, or a target takes a -1 status penalty to Perception for 1
    round. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Genie Blood Magic] Genie
    Type At 1st level, choose the type of genie that influenced your bloodline: janni,
    djinni, efreeti, marid, or shaitan. You can''t change your genie type later.
    This determines what granted spells you receive at 2nd, 5th, and 8th level. Janni
    2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Create Food]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Banishment];
    8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Confusing Colors] Jaathoom 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invisibility];
    5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Scene]; 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Punishing
    Winds] Ifrit 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental
    Form] (fire only); 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary] Faydhaan
    2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Walk]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Control
    Water]; 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Desiccate] Jabali 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Revealing
    Light]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Stone]; 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Earthquake]'
